# Every file in this directory is a BYTE fixture. The repo root's
# `* text=auto eol=lf` would rewrite the CRLF fixture's line endings on
# checkout (this repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true), which
# is precisely the byte the fixture exists to carry. `-text` turns all
# end-of-line conversion off for this directory, so what is committed is what
# lands in the working tree on every platform.
* -text
